<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Animate_Face">Animate Face <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20IconCreature.png"><img alt="IconCreature.png" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/9/9d/IconCreature.png" width="14" height="13" /></a></span></h2>
<p>Applies a FaceFX facial performance to an actor's face. The FaceFX performance is in an FXA file. This action is useful mainly if you want control over a character's facial expression but don't have dialogue for them to say with a "Speak Line" action while doing it.
</p><p>Facial animations don't play for creatures that haven't had a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Pose" title="Pose (page does not exist)">pose</a> set.
</p>
